wqy-microhei-subset.ttf holds a few hundred characters of WenQuanYi Micro Hei 0.2.0-beta, cut out with
fontTools' pyftsubset for the tests that draw a statement (test_statement_pdf.py and test_tools_orders.py):
those of the statement's own words in each of its languages, and those the tests write. It is a changed copy
of the font file: it is not the whole font and is of no use outside the tests.

